, not including the Support role.\r\n1-2 Cakers attack with each wave because they are disappointed this variant has nothing to do with Cinnamon rolls. They don't drop gold nor count towards quest progress.","gameChanges":[{"type":"initial_formation","initial":[-1,-1,164,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1]},{"type":"force_use_heroes","hero_ids":[164]},{"type":"max_active_by_tags","tag_maxes":{"dps":2,"tanking":2,"healing":2,"gold":2,"speed":2,"debuff":2,"control":2,"hunter":2,"breaking":2}},{"type":"random_monster_waves","chance":100,"range":"1,2","affects_boss_levels":true,"replace_wave":false,"monster_ids":[2087,2088,2089,2090,2091,2092],"wave_delay":0,"monster_properties":{"gold_multiplier":0,"counts_for_quests":false}}],"requirements":{"ids":[1902]},"base":{"area":1000,"rewards":[{"reward":"feat","feat_id":2601},{"reward":"increment_user_stat","stat":"corrupted_gems_earned","amount":250}]},"patrons":[{"id":1,"area":1100},{"id":2,"area":1125},{"id":3,"area":1150},{"id":4,"area":1175},{"id":5,"area":1300}]},{"id":1905,"name":"Team Up","restrictionsText":"Tess starts in the formation. She can be moved, but not removed.\r\nYou may not use unaffiliated Champions.\r\nAside from the Fallbacks, you may only use one other affiliation. Once you have added a Champion from another affiliation to the formation, you may only add Champions from that affiliation or the Fallbacks.\r\nIn non-boss areas, each time an enemy is defeated, all damaged enemies are restored to full health and all existing and future enemies in the area gain 50% speed and 50% additional damage, stacking additively. These bonuses reset when changing areas.","gameChanges":[{"type":"initial_formation","initial":[-1,-1,164,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1,-1]},{"type":"force_use_heroes","hero_ids":[164]},{"type":"only_allow_crusaders","by_expr":{"expr":"!HasTag(`unaffiliated`)","blocked_portrait":13093}},{"type":"max_active_affiliations","max":1,"except":["fallbacks"]},{"type":"global_effects","affects_boss_levels":false,"effects":["eff